  "plain": "After the 1996 events in Varginha, Brazil, where creatures are said to have been captured, a man named Pedro Aguiar reportedly took out a photograph that showed one living creature and one dead one. The documentary filmmaker James Fox tells Michels he has this from people who described seeing Aguiar show the picture. If it existed, it would be a photo of two non-human beings from the incident."
